{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01118",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 0.75,
      "end_seconds": 7.38,
      "duration_seconds": 6.63,
      "text": "Okay, doctor, we're all set in here. I'll give you the numbers when you want them."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 9.32,
      "end_seconds": 14.35,
      "duration_seconds": 5.03,
      "text": "Thanks. Hello, come in, sit down. What brings you in today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 16.3,
      "end_seconds": 20.92,
      "duration_seconds": 4.62,
      "text": "I'm, I'm here because of pain in my right shoulder."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 21.47,
      "end_seconds": 30.57,
      "duration_seconds": 9.1,
      "text": "Can you describe it a bit more for me? How strong it is, what the pattern is, what helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 31.62,
      "end_seconds": 46.82,
      "duration_seconds": 15.2,
      "text": "Severe, I'd say. Yes, lifting my arm and reaching overhead. That makes it worse. I'm hoping you can tell me something definite. And pain at night when I lie on it, too."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 47.54,
      "end_seconds": 49.62,
      "duration_seconds": 2.08,
      "text": "What aggravates it, if anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 51.21,
      "end_seconds": 63.58,
      "duration_seconds": 12.37,
      "text": "Right, you know, I notice it more with lying on that side. I've also had a clicking in the shoulder, for about three months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 68.58,
      "end_seconds": 71.44,
      "duration_seconds": 2.86,
      "text": "Is it bearing on you a lot?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 72.67,
      "end_seconds": 73.57,
      "duration_seconds": 0.9,
      "text": "Mostly moderate."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 74.8,
      "end_seconds": 85.8,
      "duration_seconds": 11.0,
      "text": "Okay, so the vitals from earlier. Heart rate 77, temp 37.0 degrees. SpO2 98 percent on room air, blood pressure 114 over 73, respiratory rate 15."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 87.47,
      "end_seconds": 88.17,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 89.17,
      "end_seconds": 94.25,
      "duration_seconds": 5.08,
      "text": "I'll need to examine you for this, it won't take long."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 95.84,
      "end_seconds": 98.17,
      "duration_seconds": 2.33,
      "text": "Raise your arm for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 114.86,
      "end_seconds": 126.88,
      "duration_seconds": 12.02,
      "text": "There is pain when you lift the arm out to the side between about sixty and one hundred and twenty degrees, and the grip strength is normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 131.1,
      "end_seconds": 136.62,
      "duration_seconds": 5.52,
      "text": "That's the examination finished. Any fall or injury or numbness at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 138.58,
      "end_seconds": 141.29,
      "duration_seconds": 2.71,
      "text": "No, none that I've noticed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 142.18,
      "end_seconds": 144.88,
      "duration_seconds": 2.7,
      "text": "Any neck pain or chest pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 149.66,
      "end_seconds": 152.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.55,
      "text": "No, I'd have said so."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 158.68,
      "end_seconds": 161.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.6,
      "text": "And your skin, any changes there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 163.88,
      "end_seconds": 164.94,
      "duration_seconds": 1.06,
      "text": "No rashes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 165.48,
      "end_seconds": 168.09,
      "duration_seconds": 2.61,
      "text": "Okay, your breathing, any trouble there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 169.53,
      "end_seconds": 170.45,
      "duration_seconds": 0.92,
      "text": "Breathing's normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 172.28,
      "end_seconds": 175.98,
      "duration_seconds": 3.7,
      "text": "Is there anything relevant on the family side?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 178.08,
      "end_seconds": 179.98,
      "duration_seconds": 1.9,
      "text": "My son has asthma."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 180.83,
      "end_seconds": 187.87,
      "duration_seconds": 7.04,
      "text": "Are there any allergies I should be aware of? Take your time, there's no rush."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 188.9,
      "end_seconds": 192.58,
      "duration_seconds": 3.68,
      "text": "I'm allergic to diclofenac, I get wheezing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 196.37,
      "end_seconds": 198.7,
      "duration_seconds": 2.33,
      "text": "Have you had any surgical procedures?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 199.38,
      "end_seconds": 208.0,
      "duration_seconds": 8.62,
      "text": "Uh, yes, I had a mole taken off my arm, a few years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 208.69,
      "end_seconds": 211.9,
      "duration_seconds": 3.21,
      "text": "Which medicines do you take at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 213.95,
      "end_seconds": 220.01,
      "duration_seconds": 6.06,
      "text": "It's, It's lisinopril, 10 milligrams, once a day for my pressure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 221.56,
      "end_seconds": 224.09,
      "duration_seconds": 2.53,
      "text": "Okay, and for how long?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 224.91,
      "end_seconds": 227.17,
      "duration_seconds": 2.26,
      "text": "About three months now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 243.94,
      "end_seconds": 247.71,
      "duration_seconds": 3.77,
      "text": "Anything in your past medical history I should know?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 248.52,
      "end_seconds": 250.61,
      "duration_seconds": 2.09,
      "text": "Yes, high blood pressure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 251.73,
      "end_seconds": 252.66,
      "duration_seconds": 0.93,
      "text": "Mm, okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 259.99,
      "end_seconds": 262.13,
      "duration_seconds": 2.14,
      "text": "Tell me about your eating."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 263.35,
      "end_seconds": 268.67,
      "duration_seconds": 5.32,
      "text": "I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 270.3,
      "end_seconds": 273.19,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "Are you in work at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 274.32,
      "end_seconds": 278.21,
      "duration_seconds": 3.89,
      "text": "Yes, I work in a bakery, early starts."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 279.39,
      "end_seconds": 285.38,
      "duration_seconds": 5.99,
      "text": "So where does that leave us? It fits best with a rotator cuff tendon problem."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 294.93,
      "end_seconds": 322.29,
      "duration_seconds": 27.36,
      "text": "I'll request an ultrasound of the shoulder, it'll help with shoulder pain. I'll request a shoulder X-ray, it'll help with shoulder pain. Keep the shoulder moving gently within comfort and avoid heavy overhead lifting. If the arm becomes numb or you get fever, or you feel really unwell, please come to the emergency department. I'd like to see you again in four weeks. Have I covered everything you wanted?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 322.85,
      "end_seconds": 326.27,
      "duration_seconds": 3.42,
      "text": "Great, thank you for your help."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 328.16,
      "end_seconds": 329.42,
      "duration_seconds": 1.26,
      "text": "All the best."
    }
  ]
}